(1994642, 273544, 47852, '<td valign="top">I find the color in the picture on the wall to be a bit distracting compared to her very pale skin.  I like the way you captured her hands though in this portrait.</td>', 'I find the color in the picture on the wall to be a bit distracting compared to her very pale skin.  I like the way you captured her hands though in this portrait.', '2006-01-02 09:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
