(1995250, 274867, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a very cool shot.I like the way the horses stand out against the stark whiteness.  I don''t care for the cropping of the foreground horse''s legs. Without the clever title, however, it says zero to me about motherhood. The photo''s theme should be apparent without nailing the viewer over the head with a cutesy title. This is definitely shoehorning a photo to meet the challenge.</td>', 'This is a very cool shot.I like the way the horses stand out against the stark whiteness.  I don''t care for the cropping of the foreground horse''s legs. Without the clever title, however, it says zero to me about motherhood. The photo''s theme should be apparent without nailing the viewer over the head with a cutesy title. This is definitely shoehorning a photo to meet the challenge.', '2006-01-02 15:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1995252, 273530, 7322, '<td valign="top">That is the world''s most patient cat. I guess this works for me in a very sillly way. What makes it work is the evident quality of the photograph.</td>', 'That is the world''s most patient cat. I guess this works for me in a very sillly way. What makes it work is the evident quality of the photograph.', '2006-01-02 15:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1995253, 274387, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a really cute idea. The child''s legs dangling high above mom''s are precious. The photo is lacking a bit in terms of quality. I think this might be a case were black and white would have worked best. I''m kind of distracted by the cheesy garland in the background, especially because this is clearly not a wintery place. It adds a jarring element to what could be a very universal image.</td>', 'This is a really cute idea. The child''s legs dangling high above mom''s are precious. The photo is lacking a bit in terms of quality. I think this might be a case were black and white would have worked best. I''m kind of distracted by the cheesy garland in the background, especially because this is clearly not a wintery place. It adds a jarring element to what could be a very universal image.', '2006-01-02 15:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1995266, 273445, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a very good family photo album shot. It''s a bit grainy and overexposed to really work for me as a real quality photo. The colors lack vibrancy and the skin tones are pale and washed out looking. The background is downright dreary (this is an instance where shallow depth of field really comes in handy). The cropping off of her arm at the left bothers me. I have a pet peeve with children wearing clothes with characters on them in photographs. I don''t mean kids shouldn''t wear these clothes (which are often their favorites). I just feel that good planning for photographing children for something other than family keepsakes should involve choosing classic clothing that won''t distract from the timelessness a photo like this can evoke. Characters and sports logos tend to date a photo and distract the viewer, IMO.  <br/> <br/>On the plus side, mom is lovely and the little boy''s joyful grin is priceless.</td>', 'This is a very good family photo album shot. It''s a bit grainy and overexposed to really work for me as a real quality photo. The colors lack vibrancy and the skin tones are pale and washed out looking. The background is downright dreary (this is an instance where shallow depth of field really comes in handy). The cropping off of her arm at the left bothers me. I have a pet peeve with children wearing clothes with characters on them in photographs. I don''t mean kids shouldn''t wear these clothes (which are often their favorites). I just feel that good planning for photographing children for something other than family keepsakes should involve choosing classic clothing that won''t distract from the timelessness a photo like this can evoke. Characters and sports logos tend to date a photo and distract the viewer, IMO.   On the plus side, mom is lovely and the little boy''s joyful grin is priceless.', '2006-01-02 15:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1995271, 273676, 11518, '<td valign="top">White balance is somewhat off, with a magenta colour cast on the photo, easily removed in PS.</td>', 'White balance is somewhat off, with a magenta colour cast on the photo, easily removed in PS.', '2006-01-02 15:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1995275, 273997, 11518, '<td valign="top">The bright blown sky is somewhat distracting. Great capture of her expression though, looks like a very nice person.</td>', 'The bright blown sky is somewhat distracting. Great capture of her expression though, looks like a very nice person.', '2006-01-02 15:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1995277, 274183, 11518, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure whether you intended for the yellowish green colour cast to be present.  It does give a feeling of sickness, being in a hospital.  Hope she is ok!</td>', 'I''m not sure whether you intended for the yellowish green colour cast to be present.  It does give a feeling of sickness, being in a hospital.  Hope she is ok!', '2006-01-02 15:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1995280, 274882, 7322, '<td valign="top">How odd that everyone looks rather sad and pensive in this photo. I like the composition quite a bit---a very classic triangle. I like the simplicity of the background. <br/> <br/>The exposure seems a bit fuzzy around the boy, as if the shutter wasn''t fast enough to capture a bit of wiggling. The skin tone on the boy and girl are a bit blown out. <br/> <br/>It bothers me that mom''s arm is not around the daughter. There is a wierd distance created visually between the mom and the daughter due to the black clothing blending in with the black background  and an emotional distance created by the daughter''s sad expression. The mother looks a bit irritated, her lips look rather pressed together. I''m only mentioning this because in evaluating this challenge I feel the emotional content is of equal importance to the technical content. I''m sure this is a very happy family. Not knowing the subjects I can only evaluate the photo.<br/> <br/>I''m guessing the tension I''m seeing in this shot is just a reflection of the subjects'' growing impatience with the photographic process.</td>', 'How odd that everyone looks rather sad and pensive in this photo. I like the composition quite a bit---a very classic triangle. I like the simplicity of the background.  The exposure seems a bit fuzzy around the boy, as if the shutter wasn''t fast enough to capture a bit of wiggling. The skin tone on the boy and girl are a bit blown out.  It bothers me that mom''s arm is not around the daughter. There is a wierd distance created visually between the mom and the daughter due to the black clothing blending in with the black background  and an emotional distance created by the daughter''s sad expression. The mother looks a bit irritated, her lips look rather pressed together. I''m only mentioning this because in evaluating this challenge I feel the emotional content is of equal importance to the technical content. I''m sure this is a very happy family. Not knowing the subjects I can only evaluate the photo. I''m guessing the tension I''m seeing in this shot is just a reflection of the subjects'' growing impatience with the photographic process.', '2006-01-02 15:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1995282, 274845, 11518, '<td valign="top">Beautiful fun looking shot BUT I would have preferred their faces to be in focus, looks like the focus is on the scarf.  Unless you selectively blurred their faces...still it would have been better with the faces in focus/unblurred.</td>', 'Beautiful fun looking shot BUT I would have preferred their faces to be in focus, looks like the focus is on the scarf.  Unless you selectively blurred their faces...still it would have been better with the faces in focus/unblurred.', '2006-01-02 15:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
