(1995313, 274843, 11518, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait!  Great pose and lighting.  Yup they do look like they could be sisters! :)</td>', 'Nice portrait!  Great pose and lighting.  Yup they do look like they could be sisters! :)', '2006-01-02 15:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1995315, 273544, 43774, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, not sure I like the grain. But well done.</td>', 'Lovely shot, not sure I like the grain. But well done.', '2006-01-02 15:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1995316, 273338, 7322, '<td valign="top">This appears to be a snapshot of a key chain. While the subject on the keychain is iconic of motherhood to some populations, there are countless others that would disagree with your title. In the end it doesn''t matter because the keychain is really the subject of this shot and a very boring subject at that. I don''t care for this extremely narrow vertical crop.</td>', 'This appears to be a snapshot of a key chain. While the subject on the keychain is iconic of motherhood to some populations, there are countless others that would disagree with your title. In the end it doesn''t matter because the keychain is really the subject of this shot and a very boring subject at that. I don''t care for this extremely narrow vertical crop.', '2006-01-02 15:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1995322, 274168, 50127, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this picture.  Great job!</td>', 'I absolutely love this picture.  Great job!', '2006-01-02 15:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1995324, 273909, 11518, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light...very holiday-feel to it... :)</td>', 'Beautiful light...very holiday-feel to it... :)', '2006-01-02 15:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1995325, 274552, 7322, '<td valign="top">Without your very leading title this is a photo of some clouds. On its own it says nothing to me about motherhood. Honestly, even if I decided to allow the title to sway my opinion I would have problems with your interpretation of motherhood. In the end this just appears to be really desperate shoehorning to fit the challenge.</td>', 'Without your very leading title this is a photo of some clouds. On its own it says nothing to me about motherhood. Honestly, even if I decided to allow the title to sway my opinion I would have problems with your interpretation of motherhood. In the end this just appears to be really desperate shoehorning to fit the challenge.', '2006-01-02 15:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1995328, 274778, 11518, '<td valign="top">Spooky looking cemetary...one of the better cemetary shots!</td>', 'Spooky looking cemetary...one of the better cemetary shots!', '2006-01-02 15:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1995332, 273952, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a cute capture but I get more of a sense of long marriage and romance than of motherhood from this. This cute couple deserves better lighting than the harsh flash of this photo.</td>', 'This is a cute capture but I get more of a sense of long marriage and romance than of motherhood from this. This cute couple deserves better lighting than the harsh flash of this photo.', '2006-01-02 15:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
