(1995338, 274183, 7322, '<td valign="top">realize a hospital room doesn''t provide the most flattering light but this is awful. Mom looks positively yellow. And why not show her belly? If I didn''t have the title to go by this woman could be in the hospital for any number of reasons.</td>', 'realize a hospital room doesn''t provide the most flattering light but this is awful. Mom looks positively yellow. And why not show her belly? If I didn''t have the title to go by this woman could be in the hospital for any number of reasons.', '2006-01-02 15:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
