(1995613, 273370, 31133, '<td valign="top">Good idea - nice, different take on the challenge. Looks like it must''ve been a lot of work to set up!  The costume, the colors, the idea - are great. I bet it would also have been striking to have the wand a bit to the side of the godmother''s face, so we could see her better. Love the tierra!!</td>', 'Good idea - nice, different take on the challenge. Looks like it must''ve been a lot of work to set up!  The costume, the colors, the idea - are great. I bet it would also have been striking to have the wand a bit to the side of the godmother''s face, so we could see her better. Love the tierra!!', '2006-01-02 17:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
