(1996792, 274375, 46097, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting, crop, subject and action. It seems a little noisy, perhaps relating to a large magnification factor. I think Neat Image, or some equivalent noise reduction filter, would have made this good shot even better.</td>', 'Lovely lighting, crop, subject and action. It seems a little noisy, perhaps relating to a large magnification factor. I think Neat Image, or some equivalent noise reduction filter, would have made this good shot even better.', '2006-01-02 22:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
