(1996825, 274552, 43437, '<td valign="top">This is so incredible.  Tornado''s are a facinating thing of mother nature. The lighting on the different elements of the cloud are incredible.  Do you have a verticle image of this?  If you could have caught a little more of the downward spiral would be incredible also.  Love it.</td>', 'This is so incredible.  Tornado''s are a facinating thing of mother nature. The lighting on the different elements of the cloud are incredible.  Do you have a verticle image of this?  If you could have caught a little more of the downward spiral would be incredible also.  Love it.', '2006-01-02 22:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1996837, 273908, 43437, '<td valign="top">Youve captured her, Ill put it texture, incredibly.  Framing is right on and her expression fits the title.  Nice job</td>', 'Youve captured her, Ill put it texture, incredibly.  Framing is right on and her expression fits the title.  Nice job', '2006-01-02 22:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
