(1996874, 274290, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great picture.  I love the way the gorilla is looking right at you, too bad the baby wasn''t - that would have really made this outstanding shot better.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Great picture.  I love the way the gorilla is looking right at you, too bad the baby wasn''t - that would have really made this outstanding shot better.  Nicely done.', '2006-01-02 22:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1996875, 273942, 43437, '<td valign="top">Unfortunatly I couldnt get mother out of this.  If you could call it maybe cells, being part of mother nature or something I cold maybe connect it but just bubbles...I still gave it a 5 even though I normally socre lower for one I cant connect to a challenge.  I like your colors and the focus on the bubbles is good, crop is nice, just dont get mother...</td>', 'Unfortunatly I couldnt get mother out of this.  If you could call it maybe cells, being part of mother nature or something I cold maybe connect it but just bubbles...I still gave it a 5 even though I normally socre lower for one I cant connect to a challenge.  I like your colors and the focus on the bubbles is good, crop is nice, just dont get mother...', '2006-01-02 22:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1996876, 275077, 43437, '<td valign="top">I cant see any real connection with mothers although I didnt dock for that.  If this wasnt so close up might have made a difference, her nose is the central focus of the pic, not usually a good focal for me.  The colors are a bit strange, maybe too saturated, more of a glowy feel might be better.  Also last point if you could get rid of the glow on the back back part, the coloring makes it too much.</td>', 'I cant see any real connection with mothers although I didnt dock for that.  If this wasnt so close up might have made a difference, her nose is the central focus of the pic, not usually a good focal for me.  The colors are a bit strange, maybe too saturated, more of a glowy feel might be better.  Also last point if you could get rid of the glow on the back back part, the coloring makes it too much.', '2006-01-02 22:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
