(1997727, 273722, 28299, '<td valign="top">Good concept; however the shallow DOF has a few areas that are out of sync and the lighting on her face seems a tad harsh. 5</td>', 'Good concept; however the shallow DOF has a few areas that are out of sync and the lighting on her face seems a tad harsh. 5', '2006-01-03 07:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
