(1997747, 274531, 37544, '<td valign="top">Very cool sculpture! I really like it. The colors are great. I wish that the darkened areas around the image where smoother.</td>', 'Very cool sculpture! I really like it. The colors are great. I wish that the darkened areas around the image where smoother.', '2006-01-03 07:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
