(1997750, 274796, 48228, '<td valign="top">This image speakes a thousand words...........</td>', 'This image speakes a thousand words...........', '2006-01-03 07:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1997752, 274849, 48228, '<td valign="top">You can see and feel the bond here between mother &amp; child, so very good......</td>', 'You can see and feel the bond here between mother & child, so very good......', '2006-01-03 07:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1997753, 274855, 48228, '<td valign="top">Great shot, actually super shot.....</td>', 'Great shot, actually super shot.....', '2006-01-03 07:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1997754, 274923, 37544, '<td valign="top">I love this! I hope that everyone gets this photo. My grandmother, when she was alive, had the hardest time with any new technical device. The VCR, microwave....well, just anything that had buttons. No matter how many times you explained it, she would just not get it. She would just say, "remotes are for the lazy people, if I want to turn the channel I will get up and do it myself!"</td>', 'I love this! I hope that everyone gets this photo. My grandmother, when she was alive, had the hardest time with any new technical device. The VCR, microwave....well, just anything that had buttons. No matter how many times you explained it, she would just not get it. She would just say, "remotes are for the lazy people, if I want to turn the channel I will get up and do it myself!"', '2006-01-03 07:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1997755, 273681, 48228, '<td valign="top">This is quite surreal, even eerie......</td>', 'This is quite surreal, even eerie......', '2006-01-03 07:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1997759, 274277, 37544, '<td valign="top">The contrast is a little too strong for a seascape photo, IMO. I feel that your composition lacks interest. It just seems that there needs to be something to look at besides water and blue sky with no clouds.</td>', 'The contrast is a little too strong for a seascape photo, IMO. I feel that your composition lacks interest. It just seems that there needs to be something to look at besides water and blue sky with no clouds.', '2006-01-03 07:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1997762, 274290, 48228, '<td valign="top">Super strong powerful image of Mother''s protecion. I would not mess with her.....</td>', 'Super strong powerful image of Mother''s protecion. I would not mess with her.....', '2006-01-03 07:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1997763, 273319, 48228, '<td valign="top">A Mothers love has no boundries as you can see in this image.....</td>', 'A Mothers love has no boundries as you can see in this image.....', '2006-01-03 07:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1997765, 274417, 48228, '<td valign="top">How did you ever manage to get this great image.....</td>', 'How did you ever manage to get this great image.....', '2006-01-03 07:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1997766, 273916, 37544, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this photo. You have cropped it very well. The one thing that bothers me is that on the hill and your mother the contrast is very high and the exposure is dark, and for the ocean and rocks, the contrast is very low. Maybe this was on purpose to draw more focus to the lower right hand corner of the image? Either way, there is something very peaceful about this picture. Great job.</td>', 'I really like the composition of this photo. You have cropped it very well. The one thing that bothers me is that on the hill and your mother the contrast is very high and the exposure is dark, and for the ocean and rocks, the contrast is very low. Maybe this was on purpose to draw more focus to the lower right hand corner of the image? Either way, there is something very peaceful about this picture. Great job.', '2006-01-03 07:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1997767, 273952, 48228, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful image......</td>', 'What a wonderful image......', '2006-01-03 07:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1997768, 275025, 48228, '<td valign="top">Another magic moment..........luv the dribble.</td>', 'Another magic moment..........luv the dribble.', '2006-01-03 07:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1997770, 274831, 48228, '<td valign="top">So cute, so lovely...</td>', 'So cute, so lovely...', '2006-01-03 07:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1997771, 274277, 48228, '<td valign="top">Beauty is seen here in Mother Natures seascape.......</td>', 'Beauty is seen here in Mother Natures seascape.......', '2006-01-03 07:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1997772, 274168, 37544, '<td valign="top">I really like this idea. I am sure that the reason you cropped the picture this way is to draw attention to the necklace. I would rather have seen the whole face as well. It would have been nice to see the full facial expression on the mother. Her simple smile and a loving look in her eyes would have really added to the overall message you trying to get across to the viewer.</td>', 'I really like this idea. I am sure that the reason you cropped the picture this way is to draw attention to the necklace. I would rather have seen the whole face as well. It would have been nice to see the full facial expression on the mother. Her simple smile and a loving look in her eyes would have really added to the overall message you trying to get across to the viewer.', '2006-01-03 07:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1997773, 273445, 48228, '<td valign="top">Nice.....</td>', 'Nice.....', '2006-01-03 07:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1997775, 274336, 37544, '<td valign="top">Very nice, soft peaceful photo. Looks like a great place to go fishing! The green canoe really adds to the image and introduces a great color other than brown to the image without taking over the overall look and theme.</td>', 'Very nice, soft peaceful photo. Looks like a great place to go fishing! The green canoe really adds to the image and introduces a great color other than brown to the image without taking over the overall look and theme.', '2006-01-03 07:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
