(1997788, 273544, 37544, '<td valign="top">Love the grain and the desaturation, it really adds to the image. I wish she didn''t look like she was in the middle of saying something. I really like everything in the photo except the Christmas lights in the window. I like how you kept the color in the painting...nice touch.</td>', 'Love the grain and the desaturation, it really adds to the image. I wish she didn''t look like she was in the middle of saying something. I really like everything in the photo except the Christmas lights in the window. I like how you kept the color in the painting...nice touch.', '2006-01-03 07:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
