(1997797, 274880, 48228, '<td valign="top">This is the first image I opened, and also the first one I have commented on in this challenge. How do you beat this image, as it is just perfect...... Number one in my book, and deserves a ribbon for sure...... Emotional, Senious, Moving, Great Composition, Wonderful B/W tones, and also a Magic image as well..... I love it.</td>', 'This is the first image I opened, and also the first one I have commented on in this challenge. How do you beat this image, as it is just perfect...... Number one in my book, and deserves a ribbon for sure...... Emotional, Senious, Moving, Great Composition, Wonderful B/W tones, and also a Magic image as well..... I love it.', '2006-01-03 07:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1997801, 273951, 37544, '<td valign="top">Looks a little overdone with neat image. Would have rec a 10 from me if the picture was in focus and not so blotchy because the composition and overall set up of the shot is wonderful. Did you notice that her ring is turned?</td>', 'Looks a little overdone with neat image. Would have rec a 10 from me if the picture was in focus and not so blotchy because the composition and overall set up of the shot is wonderful. Did you notice that her ring is turned?', '2006-01-03 07:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1997809, 273271, 2553, '<td valign="top">This image is as compelling as it is creepy.  There has got to be a story behind this, and I sense that it is not a *good* one.  I initially thought  that I would prefer if the white sheet had been draped completely behind the model; I find the dark wood in the background to be distracting, but on the other hand - it adds a bit of "darkness" to the image that may not be unwarranted.<br/> <br/>Certainly, this is outside the "norm" for thoughts on motherhood, and I would think that your score may suffer for this, but I do commend you for conceptualizing what may actually BE the "norm" for some.</td>', 'This image is as compelling as it is creepy.  There has got to be a story behind this, and I sense that it is not a *good* one.  I initially thought  that I would prefer if the white sheet had been draped completely behind the model; I find the dark wood in the background to be distracting, but on the other hand - it adds a bit of "darkness" to the image that may not be unwarranted. Certainly, this is outside the "norm" for thoughts on motherhood, and I would think that your score may suffer for this, but I do commend you for conceptualizing what may actually BE the "norm" for some.', '2006-01-03 07:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1997815, 274375, 49916, '<td valign="top">A perfect picture for mother and kid.Congratulations !!!</td>', 'A perfect picture for mother and kid.Congratulations !!!', '2006-01-03 08:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
