(1998192, 273942, 18349, '<td valign="top">Nice color, lighting, and clarity; makes for a very interesting abstract macro...<i><b>however</b></i>...it is quite vague in it''s connection to the "Mother" challenge.  It''s difficult for a viewer to establish a connection to "Mother" by looking at bubbles.  I have a feeling you''ll suffer in the voting for that reason alone.  DPC is historically rigid on challenge interpretation and if your voters can''t get the connection within a few seconds, you are out of luck.  Best wishes in this and subsequent challenges.</td>', 'Nice color, lighting, and clarity; makes for a very interesting abstract macro...however...it is quite vague in it''s connection to the "Mother" challenge.  It''s difficult for a viewer to establish a connection to "Mother" by looking at bubbles.  I have a feeling you''ll suffer in the voting for that reason alone.  DPC is historically rigid on challenge interpretation and if your voters can''t get the connection within a few seconds, you are out of luck.  Best wishes in this and subsequent challenges.', '2006-01-03 11:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
