(1999875, 273563, 47117, '<td valign="top">Sweet shot. I am bumping this up. I especially like this in b/w. I think it may have been too busy in color.</td>', 'Sweet shot. I am bumping this up. I especially like this in b/w. I think it may have been too busy in color.', '2006-01-03 21:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
