(1999885, 274591, 47117, '<td valign="top">Cute and emotive.  Would have liked to have also seen the childs face, but I understand given the theme is mother the focus should be on her.  It''s very nice.</td>', 'Cute and emotive.  Would have liked to have also seen the childs face, but I understand given the theme is mother the focus should be on her.  It''s very nice.', '2006-01-03 21:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
