(1999896, 273319, 47117, '<td valign="top">Not too keen on this shot.  I still gave it a five, but the colors all clash to me and just looks like a portrait from Walmart, to describe it the best way I know how.  The little girl is darling though, and looks like a lot of love there, which is always nice to see.</td>', 'Not too keen on this shot.  I still gave it a five, but the colors all clash to me and just looks like a portrait from Walmart, to describe it the best way I know how.  The little girl is darling though, and looks like a lot of love there, which is always nice to see.', '2006-01-03 21:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1999899, 274302, 10413, '<td valign="top">Very touching shot.</td>', 'Very touching shot.', '2006-01-03 21:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1999907, 274778, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m going to bump this up.  I just love the eary feeling from this photo and the fact it is out of the box.  The saturation is wonderful, the building in the background is great, and what is happening in the sky is very appropriate for the feel.  That bit of brighter blue in the background is a bit of a distraction from the feel, but overall, I think this is a good (8) for me.</td>', 'I''m going to bump this up.  I just love the eary feeling from this photo and the fact it is out of the box.  The saturation is wonderful, the building in the background is great, and what is happening in the sky is very appropriate for the feel.  That bit of brighter blue in the background is a bit of a distraction from the feel, but overall, I think this is a good (8) for me.', '2006-01-03 21:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
