(2001130, 274906, 25270, '<td valign="top">Extremely effective; nice use of black &amp; white</td>', 'Extremely effective; nice use of black & white', '2006-01-04 01:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2001179, 274168, 25270, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition--the caption makes it</td>', 'Excellent composition--the caption makes it', '2006-01-04 01:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2001192, 273951, 25270, '<td valign="top">Nice study!  Effective use of black &amp; white and lighting.</td>', 'Nice study!  Effective use of black & white and lighting.', '2006-01-04 01:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2001311, 274966, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Good job on exposure, great focus. Nice sound composition. Very good capture, I feel drawn into the scene nicely. Good job. :-)</td>', 'Very nice shot. Good job on exposure, great focus. Nice sound composition. Very good capture, I feel drawn into the scene nicely. Good job. :-)', '2006-01-04 01:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2001328, 273132, 19831, '<td valign="top">Hehe, nice shot. Good solid composition. Great use of dof. Might be nice in color too. Good humor factor, and looks like it was a fun shoot. Nice job :-)</td>', 'Hehe, nice shot. Good solid composition. Great use of dof. Might be nice in color too. Good humor factor, and looks like it was a fun shoot. Nice job :-)', '2006-01-04 01:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2001368, 273271, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very interesting take on the challenge. Slightly disturbing, but in a good, thought provoking, scary, twisted art sort of way, if you know what I mean. The composition is sound, I think the rose adds a nice, interesting touch. Seems like the shot could be a bit sharper, maybe some usm would help. Also, for my taste, I''m thinking that a little tweaking in levels, making a little brighter, and deeper darks, might give some strengthened depth and tonal range.</td>', 'Very interesting take on the challenge. Slightly disturbing, but in a good, thought provoking, scary, twisted art sort of way, if you know what I mean. The composition is sound, I think the rose adds a nice, interesting touch. Seems like the shot could be a bit sharper, maybe some usm would help. Also, for my taste, I''m thinking that a little tweaking in levels, making a little brighter, and deeper darks, might give some strengthened depth and tonal range.', '2006-01-04 02:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2001442, 275076, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very emotive image. Colorful, bordering on being busy, but presented well. Great use of dof. I am drawn into the image, wondering what it is that will be said in the letter. Very nice. And that is wonderful writing. Was that really hand written??? :-)  Good overall, I''m not crazy about the transparent border, in this case it seems to be a bit distracting. Maybe a small solid border could work? Nice job.</td>', 'Very emotive image. Colorful, bordering on being busy, but presented well. Great use of dof. I am drawn into the image, wondering what it is that will be said in the letter. Very nice. And that is wonderful writing. Was that really hand written??? :-)  Good overall, I''m not crazy about the transparent border, in this case it seems to be a bit distracting. Maybe a small solid border could work? Nice job.', '2006-01-04 02:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2001467, 273445, 19831, '<td valign="top">This is a ''feel good'' kind of image. Gives me a nice smile and feeling. Compositionally strong and good focus. The blown out sky is a little distracting, and a little levels tweaking could make the shot a little stronger, but overall not bad. Good job.</td>', 'This is a ''feel good'' kind of image. Gives me a nice smile and feeling. Compositionally strong and good focus. The blown out sky is a little distracting, and a little levels tweaking could make the shot a little stronger, but overall not bad. Good job.', '2006-01-04 02:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2001547, 273370, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very creative take on the challenge. Technically well done too. Nice job.</td>', 'Very creative take on the challenge. Technically well done too. Nice job.', '2006-01-04 02:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
