(2004249, 273908, 34659, '<td valign="top">WOW!!!  Absolutely stunning shot.  The personality and character of the model really reach out of the frame to the viewer.  Outstanding capture and perfect processing.  Congratulations.  I''m sure I''ll be seeing this on the front page...  10</td>', 'WOW!!!  Absolutely stunning shot.  The personality and character of the model really reach out of the frame to the viewer.  Outstanding capture and perfect processing.  Congratulations.  I''m sure I''ll be seeing this on the front page...  10', '2006-01-04 18:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004255, 274830, 34659, '<td valign="top">What a shocking portrayal - it really took me aback at first.  This shot packs quite a punch.  Great job conveying a strong emotion to the viewer and establishing a mood through your presentation.  Impressive shot and perfect title.  Bumping up... 10</td>', 'What a shocking portrayal - it really took me aback at first.  This shot packs quite a punch.  Great job conveying a strong emotion to the viewer and establishing a mood through your presentation.  Impressive shot and perfect title.  Bumping up... 10', '2006-01-04 18:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
