(2006184, 274896, 42984, '<td valign="top">The fur doesn''t look real, is that Neat Image?</td>', 'The fur doesn''t look real, is that Neat Image?', '2006-01-05 07:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006185, 272921, 42984, '<td valign="top">Well that''s certainly different :)</td>', 'Well that''s certainly different :)', '2006-01-05 07:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006186, 275028, 42984, '<td valign="top">Cute.  I don''t know if the ceramic subject works that well but I do like the way you''ve worked your composition</td>', 'Cute.  I don''t know if the ceramic subject works that well but I do like the way you''ve worked your composition', '2006-01-05 07:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006191, 274446, 43714, '<td valign="top">Great setup and models,I have days like that. Love it.</td>', 'Great setup and models,I have days like that. Love it.', '2006-01-05 07:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006192, 273723, 42984, '<td valign="top">Great light and I really like the exposure values in this image.  I believe you could have achieved an even greater impact if you''d lost the frame to the right of the tree.  There''s nothing there and it would have then shifted the subjects onto the thrids line.  Try it, I''d be interested in your thoughts.</td>', 'Great light and I really like the exposure values in this image.  I believe you could have achieved an even greater impact if you''d lost the frame to the right of the tree.  There''s nothing there and it would have then shifted the subjects onto the thrids line.  Try it, I''d be interested in your thoughts.', '2006-01-05 07:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006194, 275024, 42984, '<td valign="top">Lovely, it''s such a typical and close thing to do with a baby.  It''s such a warm concept that some more warmth in the skintones may have helped it even more.</td>', 'Lovely, it''s such a typical and close thing to do with a baby.  It''s such a warm concept that some more warmth in the skintones may have helped it even more.', '2006-01-05 07:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006195, 274417, 43714, '<td valign="top">What a great super Mom, great imagination here, love it.</td>', 'What a great super Mom, great imagination here, love it.', '2006-01-05 07:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006197, 274966, 43714, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful family.</td>', 'What a beautiful family.', '2006-01-05 07:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006199, 273176, 42984, '<td valign="top">Lovely idea, I fear that the lack of depth of field is going to hurt your score - which is a pity</td>', 'Lovely idea, I fear that the lack of depth of field is going to hurt your score - which is a pity', '2006-01-05 07:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
