(2007178, 273722, 40718, '<td valign="top">Seems to have some weird lighting going on.  Keep working on your post-processing skills.  Hair is really hard to outline properly.  Try a feather to your selection or blurring the background on a separate layer and then erasing the parts on that layer you want in focus with a soft-edged eraser.  That may lead to better results.  I like your idea though.</td>', 'Seems to have some weird lighting going on.  Keep working on your post-processing skills.  Hair is really hard to outline properly.  Try a feather to your selection or blurring the background on a separate layer and then erasing the parts on that layer you want in focus with a soft-edged eraser.  That may lead to better results.  I like your idea though.', '2006-01-05 13:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
