(2007908, 274843, 31230, '<td valign="top">You can tell they are mother and daughter. Same facial expression and way of holding those faces.  Nice idea to shoot them in this way with no shoes and dressed alike.  I also like the gray background as opposed to stark whiteness.  Suits the shoot well.</td>', 'You can tell they are mother and daughter. Same facial expression and way of holding those faces.  Nice idea to shoot them in this way with no shoes and dressed alike.  I also like the gray background as opposed to stark whiteness.  Suits the shoot well.', '2006-01-05 19:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
