(2008299, 273132, 29490, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately I find no realism here- kids don''t yell, they always get along with their siblings, and they certainly don''t keep crying to momma.  I don''t know what you''re getting at nor what message you''re trying to send but I''ll go along with it anyway.  :D<br/> <br/>Great focus, great use of dof, great tonal range, great crop, great layout.  Hmmmm - that''s only 5 greats. Ooops, there''s another.  I''ll stop now ... very nicely done - excellent photo and excellent depiction of poor mom.</td>', 'Unfortunately I find no realism here- kids don''t yell, they always get along with their siblings, and they certainly don''t keep crying to momma.  I don''t know what you''re getting at nor what message you''re trying to send but I''ll go along with it anyway.  :D Great focus, great use of dof, great tonal range, great crop, great layout.  Hmmmm - that''s only 5 greats. Ooops, there''s another.  I''ll stop now ... very nicely done - excellent photo and excellent depiction of poor mom.', '2006-01-05 20:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
