(2009831, 274265, 50737, '<td valign="top">nice one--- its the basis of all mother hood---as a doctor i can feel teh pain a mother suffers during  she bears a child in her womb--great job man.</td>', 'nice one--- its the basis of all mother hood---as a doctor i can feel teh pain a mother suffers during  she bears a child in her womb--great job man.', '2006-01-06 12:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009841, 274906, 6519, '<td valign="top">Generally speaking, I am not keen on b+w photos, nor on the high key approach. Yet here you have combined both and I love it, it works. Lighting, composition, Mom''s facial expression..... everything comes together into one very beautiful photo. 9</td>', 'Generally speaking, I am not keen on b+w photos, nor on the high key approach. Yet here you have combined both and I love it, it works. Lighting, composition, Mom''s facial expression..... everything comes together into one very beautiful photo. 9', '2006-01-06 12:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009855, 275025, 43115, '<td valign="top">I do like the (almost) square format of this photo, combined with the B&amp;W it reminds me of the good old medium format days.  The only improvement I could think of would be to have wiped off the baby''s mouth first. :)  Great job.</td>', 'I do like the (almost) square format of this photo, combined with the B&W it reminds me of the good old medium format days.  The only improvement I could think of would be to have wiped off the baby''s mouth first. :)  Great job.', '2006-01-06 12:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009857, 274290, 43115, '<td valign="top">I love the "texture" of this photo.  You can almost feel their hair on the monitor.  :)</td>', 'I love the "texture" of this photo.  You can almost feel their hair on the monitor.  :)', '2006-01-06 12:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009862, 273519, 43115, '<td valign="top">Any photo that makes me laugh out loud gets a top ranking from me.  This is just so true, the characters are SO expressive, it''s just top notch.  My only question is if the sepia actually <i>adds</i> anything to the picture... it might look better as a pure B&amp;W or in color.<br/> <br/>I think someone stole my son and put him in your picture. :)  Great job!</td>', 'Any photo that makes me laugh out loud gets a top ranking from me.  This is just so true, the characters are SO expressive, it''s just top notch.  My only question is if the sepia actually adds anything to the picture... it might look better as a pure B&W or in color. I think someone stole my son and put him in your picture. :)  Great job!', '2006-01-06 12:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009866, 274937, 43115, '<td valign="top">I do like the toning of this against the crisp white background.  Good job.</td>', 'I do like the toning of this against the crisp white background.  Good job.', '2006-01-06 12:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009869, 274236, 43115, '<td valign="top">ROTFLMAO?!?  :)</td>', 'ROTFLMAO?!?  :)', '2006-01-06 12:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009871, 273370, 43115, '<td valign="top">Great job catching such a complex lighting.  Hope you''ll describe the lighting set up after the challenge is over.  Especially the model''s face... is that just light from the sparkler?</td>', 'Great job catching such a complex lighting.  Hope you''ll describe the lighting set up after the challenge is over.  Especially the model''s face... is that just light from the sparkler?', '2006-01-06 12:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009872, 275053, 43115, '<td valign="top">The selective desat works, but would have preferred to see more of mom''s face.  It seems a little cheezy and staged for my taste, but still in the top 1/3rd of the challenge for me.  Good job with DOF and keeping the background nice and white.</td>', 'The selective desat works, but would have preferred to see more of mom''s face.  It seems a little cheezy and staged for my taste, but still in the top 1/3rd of the challenge for me.  Good job with DOF and keeping the background nice and white.', '2006-01-06 12:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009874, 274920, 43115, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting on this shot.  Great job!</td>', 'I love the lighting on this shot.  Great job!', '2006-01-06 12:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009878, 274778, 43115, '<td valign="top">I like this, but on one hand it feels a little to processed, almost to the point of feeling ''fake''.  It''s very sharp and clear, which is excellent.  I might have de-emphasized the sky a little bit.</td>', 'I like this, but on one hand it feels a little to processed, almost to the point of feeling ''fake''.  It''s very sharp and clear, which is excellent.  I might have de-emphasized the sky a little bit.', '2006-01-06 12:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
