(2010375, 275029, 45790, '<td valign="top">Congratulations for thinking outside the box and going for the "Mother of all.." I think it would have worked out better if the Mother Pin were highlighted -- it looks mighty dull. But I''m giving you a high score because you will probably get creamed in the scoring and you don''t deserve it.</td>', 'Congratulations for thinking outside the box and going for the "Mother of all.." I think it would have worked out better if the Mother Pin were highlighted -- it looks mighty dull. But I''m giving you a high score because you will probably get creamed in the scoring and you don''t deserve it.', '2006-01-06 15:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2010390, 273951, 39517, '<td valign="top">The emotional charge in this shot is truly exceptional.  I''m no expert at composition and exposure but this picture grabbed me deep inside and pulled.  Wonderfully done!</td>', 'The emotional charge in this shot is truly exceptional.  I''m no expert at composition and exposure but this picture grabbed me deep inside and pulled.  Wonderfully done!', '2006-01-06 15:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2010570, 273951, 33845, '<td valign="top">I love this shot<br/>the lighting is so perfect and it so soft.<br/>It moves me!</td>', 'I love this shotthe lighting is so perfect and it so soft.It moves me!', '2006-01-06 16:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2010611, 274387, 39517, '<td valign="top">I''m a neophyte to photography and offering critiques but I really like this shot.  The colors and the focus seem good to me but it''s the mood that I love.  There''s a feeling of friendship/love that is denoted by the long bench and the proximity of the sitters as well as a sense of mystery evoked by the point of view.  It awakens a desire to know more.  As a neophyte I expect I am more influenced by mood than technical accuracy but this is in my top three.</td>', 'I''m a neophyte to photography and offering critiques but I really like this shot.  The colors and the focus seem good to me but it''s the mood that I love.  There''s a feeling of friendship/love that is denoted by the long bench and the proximity of the sitters as well as a sense of mystery evoked by the point of view.  It awakens a desire to know more.  As a neophyte I expect I am more influenced by mood than technical accuracy but this is in my top three.', '2006-01-06 17:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2010813, 274849, 40797, '<td valign="top">I like the feel of this image. Nice use of lighting, adorable baby. Good luck!</td>', 'I like the feel of this image. Nice use of lighting, adorable baby. Good luck!', '2006-01-06 18:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
