(2011575, 274236, 30364, '<td valign="top">This looks like the work of Art, the Woodymeister.<br/>I admit that I normally dismiss photos of woodys, but I could not diss this.  Unlike most of the images of real mothers in this challenge, this one actually makes a worthwhile and apposite statement about motherhood.  The posing of the figures is brilliant (I am assuming this is indeed a posed shot, and not a fortuitous candid?)  I hate to encourage more woody shots, but this is at least a 7.</td>', 'This looks like the work of Art, the Woodymeister.I admit that I normally dismiss photos of woodys, but I could not diss this.  Unlike most of the images of real mothers in this challenge, this one actually makes a worthwhile and apposite statement about motherhood.  The posing of the figures is brilliant (I am assuming this is indeed a posed shot, and not a fortuitous candid?)  I hate to encourage more woody shots, but this is at least a 7.', '2006-01-06 23:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
