(2012064, 274290, 30364, '<td valign="top">A very strong mother image (and a very strong mother, as it happens).  Her maternal protective instinct is being communicated unequivocally.  The photograph is very nice, from a lighting, composition and processing point of view (except for the ropes; it''s advanced editing, so I think they could have been profitably removed in processing - surely they''re not a "major element"?)  Anyway, even with the ropes, it''s one of the best in this challenge.</td>', 'A very strong mother image (and a very strong mother, as it happens).  Her maternal protective instinct is being communicated unequivocally.  The photograph is very nice, from a lighting, composition and processing point of view (except for the ropes; it''s advanced editing, so I think they could have been profitably removed in processing - surely they''re not a "major element"?)  Anyway, even with the ropes, it''s one of the best in this challenge.', '2006-01-07 05:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2012070, 274850, 30364, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s brave and original, and a wonderfully welcome break from all the staged, sickly-sweet, "tender" mother images.  Plus it''s a fine image technically; it follows just enough "rules" to be photographically credible, but it breaks enough to remain delightfully unorthodox.  Original thinking and confidently adventurous photographic technique: there''s a rare combination!  10.  <br/>P.S.  Congratulations to the model, on both counts.</td>', 'Well, it''s brave and original, and a wonderfully welcome break from all the staged, sickly-sweet, "tender" mother images.  Plus it''s a fine image technically; it follows just enough "rules" to be photographically credible, but it breaks enough to remain delightfully unorthodox.  Original thinking and confidently adventurous photographic technique: there''s a rare combination!  10.  P.S.  Congratulations to the model, on both counts.', '2006-01-07 05:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2012084, 273908, 30364, '<td valign="top">Remarkable portrait ... she looks like a fine bronze sculpture!  This is a particularly interesting image in challenge terms.  On the face of it (pardon the pun), there''s nothing about it to explicitly say "mother".  And yet, when you look at that face, those beautiful eyes, and the air of quiet, unflappable dignity, she really can be nothing else BUT a mother.  The kind of mother with the strength and patience to be a breadwinner for a family of five children.  It was a bold decision to show us a mother who is not doing any overt, unequivocal "mothering" in the picture - I suppose some voters may be unable to cope with that level of subtlety.  But even so, the outstanding quality of the photograph should still see you on the front page of the results.  9.</td>', 'Remarkable portrait ... she looks like a fine bronze sculpture!  This is a particularly interesting image in challenge terms.  On the face of it (pardon the pun), there''s nothing about it to explicitly say "mother".  And yet, when you look at that face, those beautiful eyes, and the air of quiet, unflappable dignity, she really can be nothing else BUT a mother.  The kind of mother with the strength and patience to be a breadwinner for a family of five children.  It was a bold decision to show us a mother who is not doing any overt, unequivocal "mothering" in the picture - I suppose some voters may be unable to cope with that level of subtlety.  But even so, the outstanding quality of the photograph should still see you on the front page of the results.  9.', '2006-01-07 05:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2012103, 273909, 30364, '<td valign="top">What I like here is that in spite of the fact that mother and daughter are both equally visible in the shot, it is nevertheless primarily a photograph about the mother, or about the nature of motherhood.  The mother is bigger, of course, and is also placed at the stronger thirds position in the frame, but there seems to be more to it than mere physical dominance.  There''s a strong sense of the maternal relationship flowing between these two, in BOTH directions.  The daughter, from her body language, is apparently drawing confidence from the mother.  The mother is not leading the daughter (she lets the daughter feel she is setting the pace of her own adventure), but the mother is clearly alert and ready to step forward instantly if needed.  This subtle interplay is at the heart of mother-child relationships, be they people, cheetahs or ducks.  There''s something universal about it.  Bravo for capturing it so well here.  9.</td>', 'What I like here is that in spite of the fact that mother and daughter are both equally visible in the shot, it is nevertheless primarily a photograph about the mother, or about the nature of motherhood.  The mother is bigger, of course, and is also placed at the stronger thirds position in the frame, but there seems to be more to it than mere physical dominance.  There''s a strong sense of the maternal relationship flowing between these two, in BOTH directions.  The daughter, from her body language, is apparently drawing confidence from the mother.  The mother is not leading the daughter (she lets the daughter feel she is setting the pace of her own adventure), but the mother is clearly alert and ready to step forward instantly if needed.  This subtle interplay is at the heart of mother-child relationships, be they people, cheetahs or ducks.  There''s something universal about it.  Bravo for capturing it so well here.  9.', '2006-01-07 05:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2012111, 273519, 30364, '<td valign="top">Terrific candid photograph.  It captures the nice mixture of frustration and determination (or is that resignation?) that goes along with modern motherhood.  Her wry expression makes this work so well.  Of course, your alertness and photographic skills helped a bit, too! 7.</td>', 'Terrific candid photograph.  It captures the nice mixture of frustration and determination (or is that resignation?) that goes along with modern motherhood.  Her wry expression makes this work so well.  Of course, your alertness and photographic skills helped a bit, too! 7.', '2006-01-07 06:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
