(2014341, 274986, 39664, '<td valign="top">Mom is now a professional!  Congrats!  Forgive me if I miss on this but your newborn looks like a handsome little man and a bundle of joy!<br/> <br/>Technically speaking, the whites are a bit hot and the focus is soft, making the mood of the shot.  I don''t think the framing was necessary for such a tight crop.<br/> <br/>I took a bunch of shots of my new nephew and felt like I was looking up his nose in every shot....this looks like one of mine!  LOL!</td>', 'Mom is now a professional!  Congrats!  Forgive me if I miss on this but your newborn looks like a handsome little man and a bundle of joy! Technically speaking, the whites are a bit hot and the focus is soft, making the mood of the shot.  I don''t think the framing was necessary for such a tight crop. I took a bunch of shots of my new nephew and felt like I was looking up his nose in every shot....this looks like one of mine!  LOL!', '2006-01-08 01:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
