(2015014, 273897, 22734, '<td valign="top">Images like this do not usually rise above 5 in DPC. There is a definite resistance to using statues and figurines. On a technical side the lighting is very good and the overall focus fine. There is a tad of over exposure in Mary''s face. You know how to handle the camera and my suggestion is to go for a face, hands and lacking all these a momento may do. 6</td>', 'Images like this do not usually rise above 5 in DPC. There is a definite resistance to using statues and figurines. On a technical side the lighting is very good and the overall focus fine. There is a tad of over exposure in Mary''s face. You know how to handle the camera and my suggestion is to go for a face, hands and lacking all these a momento may do. 6', '2006-01-08 13:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
