(2015207, 274591, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but I''m just not comfortable seeing only the top of the child''s head.  I would really like to see his/her face.  To me, the whole issue of mother/child is the interaction between the two, and this just doesn''t convey it adequately for me.</td>', 'I like the concept, but I''m just not comfortable seeing only the top of the child''s head.  I would really like to see his/her face.  To me, the whole issue of mother/child is the interaction between the two, and this just doesn''t convey it adequately for me.', '2006-01-08 15:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015214, 275055, 2553, '<td valign="top">I''ve come back to this 4 times now trying to comment on it, but find myself in a quandry every time.  It meets the challenge, no doubt in my mind.  I like the diffuse glow a lot, as well as the black and white treatment and the composition. My perception of the interaction between mother and son throws me, and though it has no bearing on the quality of the image, it does effect my overall emotional reaction to it.</td>', 'I''ve come back to this 4 times now trying to comment on it, but find myself in a quandry every time.  It meets the challenge, no doubt in my mind.  I like the diffuse glow a lot, as well as the black and white treatment and the composition. My perception of the interaction between mother and son throws me, and though it has no bearing on the quality of the image, it does effect my overall emotional reaction to it.', '2006-01-08 15:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015215, 275066, 2553, '<td valign="top">The lighting on the baby is very nice, but the lighting and composition of this effectively put the mother in the background, both actively and figuratively for me.  Since this challenge is "Mother", I would prefer to see the mother and baby interacting in some way, and the lighting encompassing the two of them.  Yes, I know it''s nitpicking, but a first glance at this image says "BABY", and since the two are not interacting in any way, it doesn''t really say (to me) "MOTHER AND BABY".</td>', 'The lighting on the baby is very nice, but the lighting and composition of this effectively put the mother in the background, both actively and figuratively for me.  Since this challenge is "Mother", I would prefer to see the mother and baby interacting in some way, and the lighting encompassing the two of them.  Yes, I know it''s nitpicking, but a first glance at this image says "BABY", and since the two are not interacting in any way, it doesn''t really say (to me) "MOTHER AND BABY".', '2006-01-08 15:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015218, 274375, 2553, '<td valign="top">Oh, I love this!  really nice and crisp where it needs to be.</td>', 'Oh, I love this!  really nice and crisp where it needs to be.', '2006-01-08 15:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015225, 274829, 2553, '<td valign="top">A very sweet image.  The teddy bear background distracts me a lot though!  I would have preferred a tight crop of the two of them without any background showing.</td>', 'A very sweet image.  The teddy bear background distracts me a lot though!  I would have preferred a tight crop of the two of them without any background showing.', '2006-01-08 15:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015226, 274988, 2553, '<td valign="top">A nice silhouette, and you''ve captured beautiful colors in the sky, but to my eyes it doesn''t look as crisp as I would like.  I would also like to have seen a more dynamic angle for this to give it more power.  Maybe with the fence at a sharper angle somehow to give it more interest.</td>', 'A nice silhouette, and you''ve captured beautiful colors in the sky, but to my eyes it doesn''t look as crisp as I would like.  I would also like to have seen a more dynamic angle for this to give it more power.  Maybe with the fence at a sharper angle somehow to give it more interest.', '2006-01-08 15:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015227, 275025, 2553, '<td valign="top">Perfect dof here, and it''s so cool that the baby is looking right at you.  Love the black and white.</td>', 'Perfect dof here, and it''s so cool that the baby is looking right at you.  Love the black and white.', '2006-01-08 15:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015228, 274830, 2553, '<td valign="top">This image makes me so sad.  I just hate that there are people out there in situations like this.  This certainly looks like it could be the real deal - the shoes do throw me off, but nevertheless, there ARE people like this, and this is a moving depiction.</td>', 'This image makes me so sad.  I just hate that there are people out there in situations like this.  This certainly looks like it could be the real deal - the shoes do throw me off, but nevertheless, there ARE people like this, and this is a moving depiction.', '2006-01-08 15:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
