(2015970, 274476, 30049, '<td valign="top">I love the deep color and contrast in this!  Hit the thirds with each head in the top line axis.  Good use of negative space to the right and bottom.  Your choice on DOF makes sense...should go without saying, but hey - you never know.  I''m guessing top 3 on this with a nice Red ribbon to add to your stats!  Congrats in advance.</td>', 'I love the deep color and contrast in this!  Hit the thirds with each head in the top line axis.  Good use of negative space to the right and bottom.  Your choice on DOF makes sense...should go without saying, but hey - you never know.  I''m guessing top 3 on this with a nice Red ribbon to add to your stats!  Congrats in advance.', '2006-01-08 20:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015974, 274867, 33068, '<td valign="top">Cute title!  I really like how you composed the "mother" horse (ha-ha) dead  center and softened the focus of the horses in the background.  Nice caputre and excellent post processing.</td>', 'Cute title!  I really like how you composed the "mother" horse (ha-ha) dead  center and softened the focus of the horses in the background.  Nice caputre and excellent post processing.', '2006-01-08 20:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2015987, 274923, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very nice candid.  Well composed, lighting is very good.  Something about her top (her left) hand looks funny, like you did a selection to apply a slight blur to the background (sofa) and bleed over into her hand a little?  The focus on the visible portion of her leg is fine and is actually beyond (distance) her hand...so DOF should include all of the hand?  Nitpicking I know.  Overall I really like the "feel" of this shot, it''s warm and very real.  Congrats - should finish high with this one (top 5 maybe?).</td>', 'Very nice candid.  Well composed, lighting is very good.  Something about her top (her left) hand looks funny, like you did a selection to apply a slight blur to the background (sofa) and bleed over into her hand a little?  The focus on the visible portion of her leg is fine and is actually beyond (distance) her hand...so DOF should include all of the hand?  Nitpicking I know.  Overall I really like the "feel" of this shot, it''s warm and very real.  Congrats - should finish high with this one (top 5 maybe?).', '2006-01-08 20:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
