(2016335, 274265, 30364, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I really understand this.  But that''s OK: I like it a lot better than most of the entries that I do understand.  It''s not a beautiful photograph, but it is interesting and challenges the viewer to think about its meaning.  I like that.  In spite of the fact that the title is a little awkward,  I think your general intent is apparent.  It''s just the "multiple-exposure" of the hand that confuses me.  However, I like ambiguity, so it''s a 7.</td>', 'I''m not sure I really understand this.  But that''s OK: I like it a lot better than most of the entries that I do understand.  It''s not a beautiful photograph, but it is interesting and challenges the viewer to think about its meaning.  I like that.  In spite of the fact that the title is a little awkward,  I think your general intent is apparent.  It''s just the "multiple-exposure" of the hand that confuses me.  However, I like ambiguity, so it''s a 7.', '2006-01-08 22:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2016336, 273951, 44172, '<td valign="top">Fantastic emotive image, like the B&amp;W - it makes me sad, then I grab my daughters and squeeze them tight and feel better. I really hope there wasn''t a true loss here. She seems young to be an empty-nester. Nice work with such an emotional image.</td>', 'Fantastic emotive image, like the B&W - it makes me sad, then I grab my daughters and squeeze them tight and feel better. I really hope there wasn''t a true loss here. She seems young to be an empty-nester. Nice work with such an emotional image.', '2006-01-08 22:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
