(2016382, 274830, 30364, '<td valign="top">You''ll dislike this comment, but I don''t think one can successfully simulate pathos.  The quality of the photograph is very nice, though.  Very good tonal range.  6.</td>', 'You''ll dislike this comment, but I don''t think one can successfully simulate pathos.  The quality of the photograph is very nice, though.  Very good tonal range.  6.', '2006-01-08 22:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
