(2018566, 274880, 93, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by lhall:</b></div><hr/><i> I looked at the times on the after challenge comments and thought - what the heck are you all doing up in the middle of the night?!! <br/> <br/>Thanks for the votes, and for the great comments that kept my hopes for a good score alive all week.<br/> <br/>There were a couple of comments about her makeup, which made me kind of laugh.  I daresay that <i>most</i> women who were going to have a shot like this done, that they planned on hanging on their wall and looking at for the rest of their lives, would <i>want</i> to wear a little makeup!<br/> <br/>In reality, all she had on was a little bit of eye makeup, and some lipstick.  This woman has the most perfect skin I have ever seen, and is absolutely gorgeous, and obviously, is a wonderful model. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Sorry, I really don''t mean anything against you or the model, but it does say a lot about society as a whole that a mother wouldn''t be comfortable looking as natural as possible in a moment like this.<br/> <br/>Sad really.. but that''s just one opinion.</td>', 'Originally posted by lhall: I looked at the times on the after challenge comments and thought - what the heck are you all doing up in the middle of the night?!!  Thanks for the votes, and for the great comments that kept my hopes for a good score alive all week. There were a couple of comments about her makeup, which made me kind of laugh.  I daresay that most women who were going to have a shot like this done, that they planned on hanging on their wall and looking at for the rest of their lives, would want to wear a little makeup! In reality, all she had on was a little bit of eye makeup, and some lipstick.  This woman has the most perfect skin I have ever seen, and is absolutely gorgeous, and obviously, is a wonderful model.   Sorry, I really don''t mean anything against you or the model, but it does say a lot about society as a whole that a mother wouldn''t be comfortable looking as natural as possible in a moment like this. Sad really.. but that''s just one opinion.', '2006-01-09 14:12:57.000000', NULL, 0),
