(2018907, 272921, 48456, '<td valign="top">c''est bon i like the photo. others wont see anything mother-related because theres no babies and no kissing and no hand holding or patting on the head, but i think that there is more to those nice gestures that can be attributed to motherhood, which we can see done here where the mini shroomies are emerging from the base of the big shroom, its like mothers providing a living space, providing shelter, security and somewhere to hold onto, like they are attached to the big shroom.<br/>mothers are liek a package deal and theyre not only pats on the head. theres alot mroe to it than that.<br/>so 10 on 10 for originality and creativity though i must speak honestly and i say im not the biggest fan of the light setup here.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-01-09 16:00:26.</i></td>', 'c''est bon i like the photo. others wont see anything mother-related because theres no babies and no kissing and no hand holding or patting on the head, but i think that there is more to those nice gestures that can be attributed to motherhood, which we can see done here where the mini shroomies are emerging from the base of the big shroom, its like mothers providing a living space, providing shelter, security and somewhere to hold onto, like they are attached to the big shroom.mothers are liek a package deal and theyre not only pats on the head. theres alot mroe to it than that.so 10 on 10 for originality and creativity though i must speak honestly and i say im not the biggest fan of the light setup here.', '2006-01-09 15:59:46.000000', '2006-01-09 16:00:26.000000', 0),
(2018925, 275066, 33400, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by thomaspeople:</b></div><hr/><i> Beautiful picture and well stated.  I bet some won''t get the point of the lighting, but I like it. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I was right.  No one seemed to get the point of motherhood.  I expect the guys to miss the point, but some of the moms should have realized that this is what mothers do.<br/>Without the child she is not a mother.  And a good mother always sees her child as the bright spot in her universe.  You did well.  Ignore the nay-sayers.</td>', 'Originally posted by thomaspeople: Beautiful picture and well stated.  I bet some won''t get the point of the lighting, but I like it.   I was right.  No one seemed to get the point of motherhood.  I expect the guys to miss the point, but some of the moms should have realized that this is what mothers do.Without the child she is not a mother.  And a good mother always sees her child as the bright spot in her universe.  You did well.  Ignore the nay-sayers.', '2006-01-09 16:05:27.000000', NULL, 0),
