(2020354, 273271, 19831, '<td valign="top">This very provocative image has stuck in my mind, and I had to return to it :-) I wish you had more info with it, but perhaps it is better to allow the viewers own imagination to fill in the details. I would say, definitely do not be discouraged by the score on this photo. I think that this kind of image can strike a chord even unknowingly in many viewers, and thus cause an unfavorable response. This IMO, is definitely not a bad thing. It transcends being just a ''pretty picture'', and becomes something that invokes an emotional response, some deep thought, good or bad, and willingly or not revisits the mind of the audience. My opinion on technicals still stand :-), but I say well done, this is a photo that you should be quite proud of, and I thank-you :-)</td>', 'This very provocative image has stuck in my mind, and I had to return to it :-) I wish you had more info with it, but perhaps it is better to allow the viewers own imagination to fill in the details. I would say, definitely do not be discouraged by the score on this photo. I think that this kind of image can strike a chord even unknowingly in many viewers, and thus cause an unfavorable response. This IMO, is definitely not a bad thing. It transcends being just a ''pretty picture'', and becomes something that invokes an emotional response, some deep thought, good or bad, and willingly or not revisits the mind of the audience. My opinion on technicals still stand :-), but I say well done, this is a photo that you should be quite proud of, and I thank-you :-)', '2006-01-09 22:51:39.000000', NULL, 0),
