(2028143, 274986, 42013, '<td valign="top">First of all, congrats.  I sure there are many things left unstated in the title and this must be a very personal image for you.  I like the narrow DOF, and I think the BW is appropriate and works well for the subject.  Only thing which doesn''t appeal to me is the sleeve?? in the lower left.  But, Its not like you can command a baby to go to sleep and spend an hour taking pics. :)  Perfect for the challenge.</td>', 'First of all, congrats.  I sure there are many things left unstated in the title and this must be a very personal image for you.  I like the narrow DOF, and I think the BW is appropriate and works well for the subject.  Only thing which doesn''t appeal to me is the sleeve?? in the lower left.  But, Its not like you can command a baby to go to sleep and spend an hour taking pics. :)  Perfect for the challenge.', '2006-01-11 21:32:55.000000', NULL, 0),
