(2039156, 274579, 39664, '<td valign="top">Thanks Mel and John.  Mel....I don''t think of this as a snaphshot but more of a candid.  John, I have a hard time with lighting in a gym and shooting sports, they tend to frown on the use of a flash.<br/> <br/>I am amazed at how many folks referred to MOM as GRANDMA....I hope my subject doesn''t see this shot on here! <br/> <br/>Thanks again!</td>', 'Thanks Mel and John.  Mel....I don''t think of this as a snaphshot but more of a candid.  John, I have a hard time with lighting in a gym and shooting sports, they tend to frown on the use of a flash. I am amazed at how many folks referred to MOM as GRANDMA....I hope my subject doesn''t see this shot on here!  Thanks again!', '2006-01-15 20:22:02.000000', NULL, 0),
