(2039331, 274920, 41100, '<td valign="top">I love this picture!! My mom, grandmother and I have taken similar multi-generational photographs for several years now and they always turn out to be stunning representations of our personalities and capture our similar features! They are especially meaningful now that my grandmother has passed away. I''m sure we''ll keep the tradition once I have a little girl one of these days (fingers crossed!). I strongly encourage all of the women out there to gather important women in THEIR families and try something like this. It will be something you will cherish for years to come.</td>', 'I love this picture!! My mom, grandmother and I have taken similar multi-generational photographs for several years now and they always turn out to be stunning representations of our personalities and capture our similar features! They are especially meaningful now that my grandmother has passed away. I''m sure we''ll keep the tradition once I have a little girl one of these days (fingers crossed!). I strongly encourage all of the women out there to gather important women in THEIR families and try something like this. It will be something you will cherish for years to come.', '2006-01-15 21:27:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(2040829, 274591, 25232, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by nsbca7:</b></div><hr/><i> On camera flash ruined a potentially good picture. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I''m sorry. New voting structure strikes again. I didn''t leave this comment on your image. I put it on a different image and it ended up on yours. I wonder you weren''t confused as to why i would post that to your image. Again, sorry.</td>', 'Originally posted by nsbca7: On camera flash ruined a potentially good picture.   I''m sorry. New voting structure strikes again. I didn''t leave this comment on your image. I put it on a different image and it ended up on yours. I wonder you weren''t confused as to why i would post that to your image. Again, sorry.', '2006-01-16 02:57:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(2045798, 274880, 33576, '<td valign="top">I love it!!!  Absolutley beautiful!!  In my book there is nothing sickly or weird about it at all.  I kiss my kids on the lips all of the time.  I saw this one and just fell in love with it.  Keep up the good work!!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-01-16 23:03:01.</i></td>', 'I love it!!!  Absolutley beautiful!!  In my book there is nothing sickly or weird about it at all.  I kiss my kids on the lips all of the time.  I saw this one and just fell in love with it.  Keep up the good work!!!', '2006-01-16 23:00:51.000000', '2006-01-16 23:03:01.000000', 0),
(2047794, 274864, 50641, '<td valign="top">Hi.  <br/>With respect to your post in the "Title Importance" thread in the forums:  Your title confused me because I perceived the hue as <i>purple</i>. As for mood, I kept wondering whether you referred to post-partum depression.  I wouldn''t make the connection you mentioned because Mint Schnapps is not a common-enough drink - wine or beer might have done a better job.  But the connection itself is valid - getting drunk-&gt; getting pregnant - maybe something like ''Consequences'' or ''Regrets'' might have put your meaning across?. It was an interesting shot with funky colors.  Better luck next time.<br/> <br/>(or maybe ''A Nine-Month Hangover'')<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-01-17 11:23:35.</i></td>', 'Hi.  With respect to your post in the "Title Importance" thread in the forums:  Your title confused me because I perceived the hue as purple. As for mood, I kept wondering whether you referred to post-partum depression.  I wouldn''t make the connection you mentioned because Mint Schnapps is not a common-enough drink - wine or beer might have done a better job.  But the connection itself is valid - getting drunk-> getting pregnant - maybe something like ''Consequences'' or ''Regrets'' might have put your meaning across?. It was an interesting shot with funky colors.  Better luck next time. (or maybe ''A Nine-Month Hangover'')', '2006-01-17 11:19:15.000000', '2006-01-17 11:23:35.000000', 0),
