(2552394, 274387, 16912, '<td valign="top">comment from my <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=336521&amp;page=1" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">1-4-0</a>  thread...<br/> <br/>lol, you sent me to this as a ''not so good'' shot but it still scored 5.8 ;) This fits the ''mother'' challenge well and in an amusing way but the  bench seems to take up too much of the frame for me and think the top of the bench should have been straight? Am not sure what lens you used but if its was not already wide open you could have opened it up and blurred the rather busy bg some more.</td>', 'comment from my 1-4-0  thread... lol, you sent me to this as a ''not so good'' shot but it still scored 5.8 ;) This fits the ''mother'' challenge well and in an amusing way but the  bench seems to take up too much of the frame for me and think the top of the bench should have been straight? Am not sure what lens you used but if its was not already wide open you could have opened it up and blurred the rather busy bg some more.', '2006-06-25 19:09:34.000000', NULL, 0),
