(2672455, 275142, 40106, '<td valign="top">i think this shot would be a lot stronger without the leaf in the way.  its a wonderful idea and great composition (without the leaf).  could use a little more color saturation, or perhaps make is a black and white shot.</td>', 'i think this shot would be a lot stronger without the leaf in the way.  its a wonderful idea and great composition (without the leaf).  could use a little more color saturation, or perhaps make is a black and white shot.', '2006-07-28 20:12:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(2684346, 274330, 60862, '<td valign="top">I think this is an amazing shot, from your creative thinking to how you executed it.<br/> <br/>I do agree with the other commenters about the asymmetry in the hands.  I think the best would be to paint the right hand black.  It would add some visual interest.  But that''s minor.<br/> <br/>Great job!  Going in my favorites.</td>', 'I think this is an amazing shot, from your creative thinking to how you executed it. I do agree with the other commenters about the asymmetry in the hands.  I think the best would be to paint the right hand black.  It would add some visual interest.  But that''s minor. Great job!  Going in my favorites.', '2006-08-01 16:59:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(2705001, 274906, 27767, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful photo. There is so much love radiating from your expression, and I think it captures an emotive example of motherhood. As for the technical aspects, I think that high-key works very well for this shot, and all the skin tones are really nice and soft. The composition is excellent, and everything is in nice sharp focus. The plain white background is great since it leaves all the viewer''s focus on the primary subjects. Wonderful job!</td>', 'Very beautiful photo. There is so much love radiating from your expression, and I think it captures an emotive example of motherhood. As for the technical aspects, I think that high-key works very well for this shot, and all the skin tones are really nice and soft. The composition is excellent, and everything is in nice sharp focus. The plain white background is great since it leaves all the viewer''s focus on the primary subjects. Wonderful job!', '2006-08-08 02:43:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2799808, 274843, 45754, '<td valign="top">I love this shot! I love it because it portrays your feelings for each other perfectly and because my mom is also MY bext friend and this is exactly how I feel too. A great shot! You are both very cool looking. Love the pose. :o)This is a 10 for sure!</td>', 'I love this shot! I love it because it portrays your feelings for each other perfectly and because my mom is also MY bext friend and this is exactly how I feel too. A great shot! You are both very cool looking. Love the pose. :o)This is a 10 for sure!', '2006-09-05 09:12:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(2858454, 275024, 22689, '<td valign="top">Your portfolio is very interesting !<br/>I have chose this one because it''s very emotive , I''d love to have grandchildren and feel what you capture but Mambe can''t have babies ...<br/>Beautiful photo !<br/> <br/>(This is a translation of the comments made by my mother , thanks for your kind words for her)</td>', 'Your portfolio is very interesting !I have chose this one because it''s very emotive , I''d love to have grandchildren and feel what you capture but Mambe can''t have babies ...Beautiful photo ! (This is a translation of the comments made by my mother , thanks for your kind words for her)', '2006-09-23 07:34:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(3045820, 274986, 66398, '<td valign="top">Ohhhh.... this is so precious.  Congrats. Don''t worry about the age!! You''ll love this one just as much as the other 4 and now that you''re older you''ll appreciate the things you may have taken for granted with the others.</td>', 'Ohhhh.... this is so precious.  Congrats. Don''t worry about the age!! You''ll love this one just as much as the other 4 and now that you''re older you''ll appreciate the things you may have taken for granted with the others.', '2006-11-20 02:20:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(3094493, 274843, 63360, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful photo that you will probably always treasure.  I feel that way about my mother, too.</td>', 'This is a wonderful photo that you will probably always treasure.  I feel that way about my mother, too.', '2006-12-06 21:15:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(3257244, 274277, 64629, '<td valign="top">wow low score for this pic. great colors great shot!!</td>', 'wow low score for this pic. great colors great shot!!', '2007-01-19 19:14:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(3277657, 274986, 14986, '<td valign="top">Awww...how special!  I''m not overly fond of the angle here for some reason, but some shots are just beyond the technical aspects and this is certainly one of them.  Lot''s of love here.  I have two girls, 13 years apart and there are definite benefits to having a younger child (including more time to save for college!)</td>', 'Awww...how special!  I''m not overly fond of the angle here for some reason, but some shots are just beyond the technical aspects and this is certainly one of them.  Lot''s of love here.  I have two girls, 13 years apart and there are definite benefits to having a younger child (including more time to save for college!)', '2007-01-24 21:24:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(3321327, 274849, 70369, '<td valign="top">I love this photo and it makes me desperate to run into my garage studio and make the same photo with my child. I hope that borrowing your idea will be taken as a form of flattery.. I''m touched by this. It''s a superb image !!!!</td>', 'I love this photo and it makes me desperate to run into my garage studio and make the same photo with my child. I hope that borrowing your idea will be taken as a form of flattery.. I''m touched by this. It''s a superb image !!!!', '2007-02-03 00:23:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3379439, 274880, 24111, '<td valign="top">This is heaven!!<br/>I want to thank you for the kind thread you started about my dream win!!! Much appreciation!<br/>I see you are in Virginia too!!<br/></td>', 'This is heaven!!I want to thank you for the kind thread you started about my dream win!!! Much appreciation!I see you are in Virginia too!!', '2007-02-18 23:46:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(3412997, 274880, 74270, '<td valign="top">I love delicate and intimate nature of the shot. I think any family would love to have this print displayed in their home. Great job and congrats on your win, well deserved.</td>', 'I love delicate and intimate nature of the shot. I think any family would love to have this print displayed in their home. Great job and congrats on your win, well deserved.', '2007-02-28 09:18:14.000000', NULL, 0),
