(4568022, 274906, 90947, '<td valign="top">I love your picture.  I reminds me of a painting in the Czech National Gallery, a 16th century nursing Madonna... not one of those horrible stylized monstrosities, but a peasant girl nursing a real child... painted at the time the child just falls asleep.  It is my favorite image... yours has risen to a close second.</td>', 'I love your picture.  I reminds me of a painting in the Czech National Gallery, a 16th century nursing Madonna... not one of those horrible stylized monstrosities, but a peasant girl nursing a real child... painted at the time the child just falls asleep.  It is my favorite image... yours has risen to a close second.', '2008-03-16 20:34:28.000000', NULL, 0),
